---

**Key findings:**
- **Malware:** NetSupport RAT (signature-confirmed by Suricata/ET Pro alerts)
- **Victim:** oboomwald on DESKTOP-B8TQK49 (10.11.26.183)
- **Primary C2:** 194.180.191.64:443, POST /fakeurl.htm
- **Delivery vector:** modandcrackedapk.com (ZPHP malware distribution domain)
- **Active indicators:** Repeated 54-minute beaconing pattern, geolocation check (NetSupport standard), secondary exfiltration to classicgrand.com
